#, python-brace-format
msgid "Subkategori: {subgroup}"
msgstr "Subcategory: {subgroup}"

#. Translators: Line of the details of an emoji whose skin tone, gender or direction can be chosen.
msgid "Dapat dipersonalisasi"
msgstr "Can be personalized"

#. Translators: Line of the details of an item. {keywords} lists its search keywords.
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kata kunci: {keywords}"
msgstr "Keywords: {keywords}"

#. Translators: Title of the dialog with the details of an item.
msgid "Detail"
msgstr "Details"

#. Translators: List of the shortcuts of the insert emoji dialog.
msgid ""
"Enter: sisipkan emoji yang dipilih, atau seluruh rangkaian.\n"
"Shift+Enter: personalisasi warna kulit, jenis kelamin, atau arah.\n"
"Ctrl+Enter: tambah ke rangkaian.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+Backspace: hapus emoji terakhir dari rangkaian.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+Delete: kosongkan rangkaian.\n"
"Ctrl+R: bacakan isi rangkaian.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+C: salin tanpa menyisipkan.\n"
"Ctrl+D: tambah ke favorit atau hapus dari favorit.\n"
"Alt+Enter: detail emoji.\n"
"Ctrl+Tab dan Ctrl+Shift+Tab: tab berikutnya atau sebelumnya.\n"
"Ctrl+1, Ctrl+2, Ctrl+3: tab Emoji, Simbol, atau Kaomoji.\n"
"Ctrl+F: pindah ke kolom Cari.\n"
"Panah kanan dan kiri di daftar Hasil: lompat ke subkategori berikutnya atau sebelumnya, saat Subkategori diatur ke Semua subkategori.\n"
"Escape: tutup."
msgstr ""
"Enter: insert the selected emoji, or the whole collection.\n"
"Shift+Enter: personalize skin tone, gender or direction.\n"
"Ctrl+Enter: add to the collection.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+Backspace: remove the last emoji from the collection.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+Delete: clear the collection.\n"
"Ctrl+R: read the collection.\n"
"Ctrl+Shift+C: copy without inserting.\n"
"Ctrl+D: add to or remove from favorites.\n"
"Alt+Enter: emoji details.\n"
"Ctrl+Tab and Ctrl+Shift+Tab: next or previous tab.\n"
"Ctrl+1, Ctrl+2, Ctrl+3: Emoji, Symbols or Kaomoji tab.\n"
"Ctrl+F: move to the Search field.\n"
"Right and left arrows in the Results list: jump to the next or previous subcategory, when Subcategory is set to All subcategories.\n"
"Escape: close."

