#. Translators: Message of the welcome dialog shown while Emoji ID is being installed.
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"Add-on ini membacakan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia, apa pun suara TTS yang kamu pakai.\n"
"\n"
"Kalau add-on ini bermanfaat, kamu bisa mendukung pengembangnya lewat donasi sukarela melalui GoPay. Pilih Donasi untuk melihat nomornya, atau Tidak Sekarang untuk melanjutkan instalasi."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Emoji ID!\n"
"\n"
"This add-on reads emoji in Indonesian, whatever TTS voice you use.\n"
"\n"
"If you find it useful, you can support the developer with a voluntary donation through GoPay. Choose Donate to see the number, or Not Now to continue the installation."

#. Translators: Donation details. {number} is the GoPay phone number, {name} is the account holder.
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Metode: GoPay\n"
"Nomor HP: {number}\n"
"Atas nama: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Donasi berapa pun membantu add-on ini terus diperbarui. Terima kasih!"
msgstr ""
"Method: GoPay\n"
"Phone number: {number}\n"
"Account name: {name}\n"
"\n"
"Any amount helps keep this add-on updated. Thank you!"

#. Translators: Added to the donation details after the GoPay number was copied.
msgid "Nomor GoPay sudah disalin ke papan klip."
msgstr "The GoPay number has been copied to the clipboard."

#. Add-on summary/title, usually the user visible name of the add-on
#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "Emoji ID - Pembaca Emoji Bahasa Indonesia"
msgstr "Emoji ID - Indonesian Emoji Reader"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid "Membacakan emoji dalam bahasa Indonesia, apa pun bahasa suara TTS yang dipakai. Mendukung emoji dasar, rangkaian ZWJ, bendera, keycap, dan warna kulit."
msgstr "Reads emoji in Indonesian, whatever language your TTS voice uses. Supports basic emoji, ZWJ sequences, flags, keycaps, and skin tones."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"\n"
"- Dialog Sisipkan Emoji yang mirip panel emoji Windows 11, dengan tab Emoji, Simbol, dan Kaomoji: cari dengan kata bahasa Indonesia, jelajahi kategori Windows, personalisasi warna kulit (juga per orang untuk emoji dua orang), jenis kelamin, dan arah dengan Shift+Enter untuk emoji yang mendukungnya, simpan favorit dan daftar terakhir dipakai, rangkai beberapa emoji lalu sisipkan sekaligus, atau salin. Setiap tombol menyebut tombol pintasnya, dan F1 menampilkan semuanya. Dialog hanya terbuka di tempat mengetik, kecuali tombol pintasnya ditekan dua kali. Dialog ini tidak punya tombol pintas bawaan; tetapkan di Gestur Masukan.\n"
"- Mode baca ringkas: hanya membacakan sejumlah emoji berturut-turut, lalu \"dan N emoji lainnya\".\n"
"- Emoji yang sama dan berulang sekarang dibacakan tanpa kata \"kali\", misalnya \"3 emoji bendera Indonesia\".\n"
"- Pesan pemeriksa pembaruan saat tidak ada versi baru sekarang berbunyi \"Emoji ID versi ... sudah versi terbaru\".\n"
"- Setelah memasang pembaruan, teks baru langsung tampil dalam bahasa NVDA tanpa perlu memulai ulang NVDA dua kali.\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- Insert Emoji dialog, modelled on the Windows 11 emoji panel, with Emoji, Symbols and Kaomoji tabs: search with Indonesian words, browse the Windows categories, personalize skin tones (also for each person of two person emoji), gender and direction with Shift+Enter for emoji that support it, keep favorites and recently used items, collect several emoji and insert them at once, or copy them. Every button names its shortcut, and F1 lists them all. The dialog only opens where you can type, unless its gesture is pressed twice. It has no default gesture: assign one in Input Gestures.\n"
"- Brief reading mode: read only a set number of emoji in a row, then \"dan N emoji lainnya\".\n"
"- Repeated identical emoji are now read without the word \"kali\", for example \"3 emoji bendera Indonesia\".\n"
"- The update check message when no newer version exists now uses more natural Indonesian wording.\n"
"- After installing an update, new texts appear in the NVDA language right away, without restarting NVDA twice.\n"
"\t"

#. Translators: Name of the symbol dictionary shown in NVDA's speech settings.
msgid "Tanda baca dan simbol bahasa Indonesia (Emoji ID)"
msgstr "Indonesian punctuation and symbols (Emoji ID)"
